Still 1.2.0. Pocket mode waits for a headset instead of refusing one.

Arm it with no headset and it stays armed: the microphone simply stays open, nothing listens for taps, and an amber notice says why. Turn a headset on — or off and on again, if it dropped — and it starts working with nothing else to do. So you can arm it and then put your helmet on.

The panel also pulls down to a handle now, and stays down until you pull it up.
